Endpoints

GET /summoner/:gameName/:tagLine
Returns: SummonerProfileResponse

GET /summoner/:gameName/:tagLine/matches?count=20&queue=solo        //You can use this without the ?count or ?queue or with just one of those
Returns: MatchHistoryResponse

GET /summoner/:gameName/:tagLine/champions
Returns: ChampionStatsResponse

GET /summoner/:gameName/:tagLine/ranked
Returns: RankedResponse

Supported queues: Normal Draft (400), Ranked Solo/Duo (420), Ranked Flex (440)
Default count: 20, max: 50